    "name": "FitLat - Module 9 Workout Logging & Progress Tracking",
    "description": "FitLat Module 9 – Workout Logging & Progress Tracking.\n\nPREPARATION:\n1. Start backend at http://localhost:8080.\n2. Select Postman environment 'FitLat Local'.\n3. Ensure memberToken and trainerToken are valid JWT access tokens for two different accounts.\n4. Ensure at least one ACTIVE exercise exists. Folder 01.1 saves the first exercise ID as activeExerciseId when possible. If the list is empty, create an active exercise using the Module 7 ADMIN collection, then set activeExerciseId manually.\n5. Run Folder 01 before Folders 02–05. Run Folder 06.3–06.5 in order; this sequence creates its own session and can run after the main session is completed.\n\nVARIABLES:\nbaseUrl, memberToken, trainerToken, activeExerciseId, sessionId, sessionExerciseId, setLogId, secondSetLogId, cancelSessionId, validationSessionId, validationSessionExerciseId.\n\nGenerated IDs are saved to the selected Postman environment by test scripts. If a status assertion fails, inspect the actual response and GlobalExceptionHandler before changing application code.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "59381735",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/59381735-bd825886-fe71-48fa-8d09-dc75b389a505?source=collection_link"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Workout Sessions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01.1 - Discover active exercises",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP status is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "let data = pm.response.json();",
                  "let list = Array.isArray(data) ? data : (data.content || data.data || []);",
                  "if (list.length > 0 && list[0].id != null) {",
                  "    if (pm.environment.name) pm.environment.set(\"activeExerciseId\", String(list[0].id));",
                  "    else pm.collectionVariables.set(\"activeExerciseId\", String(list[0].id));",
                  "    console.log(\"activeExerciseId =\", list[0].id);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test(\"Response contains an exercise list\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(list).to.be.an(\"array\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/exercises",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "exercises"
